SUMMARY:Danvers Golf at Peabody (W 65–7)
LOCATION:The Meadow at Peabody
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 65\, Peabody 7\nThe Fal
 cons opened the season with a runaway win at The Meadow\, taking 65 of the
  72 points on offer.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletic
 s.org/golf/schedule.html
