SUMMARY:Danvers Golf at St. Mary's (L 170–174)
LOCATION:Gannon Golf Course\, Lynn
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 170\, St. Mary's 174\nA four-point l
 oss on a rainy day at Gannon in the first non-league match of the year\, l
 ess than 24 hours after the opener. Ben Campbell led the Falcons with 28 p
 oints and Austin Patuto had 27.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalc
 onsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
