SUMMARY:Danvers Golf at Salem (W 47–25)
LOCATION:Olde Salem Greens\, Salem
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 47\, Salem 25\nPlaying 
 for the fourth time in four days to start the season\, Danvers won on the 
 road at Olde Salem Greens to get back to 2–2. Ben Blum (7–2)\, Ryan Mo
 ore and Drew Carlson (both 6.5–2.5) earned their first varsity wins\, an
 d Wes Maylor won 6.5–2.5.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsa
 thletics.org/golf/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
