LOCATION:Rowley Country Club
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 30.5\, Masconomet 41.5\
 nLucas Silva (6–3)\, Wes Maylor (5–4) and Brady Swanton (5–4) won th
 eir matches and Anthony Sheehan earned a half in the regular-season finale
 \, but Masconomet's Brendan O'Connor shot a 2-under 33 to lead the Chiefta
