BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:golf-19@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T090000
DURATION:PT5H
SUMMARY:Danvers Golf: Division 2 North Sectional (11th of 15)
LOCATION:Bradford Country Club\, Haverhill
DESCRIPTION:MIAA tournament\nFinished 11th of 15 with 348 (+64)\nIn the las
 t MIAA sectional before the state switches formats in 2027\, the Falcons p
 laced 11th of 15 teams at Bradford. Junior Wes Maylor led Danvers with a 9
 -over 81. Masconomet won with 294\, and Newburyport and Milton took the ot
 her two spots in the state final.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfa
 lconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:golf-18@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T090000
DURATION:PT5H
SUMMARY:Danvers Golf: NEC Open (4th of 10)
LOCATION:Tedesco Country Club\, Marblehead
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference tournament\nFinished 4th of 10 with 179
  (+39)\nCold temperatures\, swirling winds and lightning-fast greens made 
 Tedesco play tough at the conference's season-ending tournament. Danvers f
 inished fourth of 10 teams with a 179\, one shot ahead of Swampscott\, and
  junior Ben Campbell tied for seventh individually with a 15-over 85. Marb
 lehead won the team title with 163 and Tyler Forbes was the medalist with 
 a 79.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/sche
 dule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/golf/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
